```css
/* should generate diagnostics */

// Functions declared in a file loaded via `@use` are not resolved; the rule only
// knows about functions declared in the same file. See https://github.com/biomejs/biome/issues/10800.
@use 'fns' as *;

.a {
  width: bpx(1);
}

```

